# Class declaration with empty structural metadata
# Verifies that a class can have the two-bracket form with an empty metadata dict
[
  # Define a test class with empty structural metadata bracket
  TestClass: [class [let TestClass a] []
    test-method: [Fn@Bool [a a]]]

  # Return a simple value to verify the class declaration typechecks
  result: True
]

---

%.result
=== out
Variant(Boolean.True, Null)
